  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Kitsune understand how to request help, and then throw it in the helper's face by doing something completely unexpected with it.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aid of the minor kami class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you are about to select your cantrips and orisons for the day with the aid of the minor kami class feature, you may choose not to select your full complement of cantrips and orisons. For each that you do not select, you gain 1 temporary spirit point that lasts for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> As Aid of the Kitsune is all about breaking expectations, it is not considered to be an \"Aid\" feat by spells, petitions, feats, and other abilities that care about such things.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
